    description: 'With this function you can check that a given user has a chosen privilege. The function will return true or false in the System Asynchronous Event depending on whether the privilege is enabled or not, and if you set the attempt_resolution argument to true and the privilege isn\'t enabled, it will also open a system dialog (suspending the game) to prompt the user to upgrade the account or whateve...',
